                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa54c756-2f67-454f-bd4e-2124022c6ab6",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aa3c0ab-f600-3049-8a89-76e6d61c2dac",
                        "source_sense_id": "b96699fc-136f-34b4-9a27-0f9797d20734",
                        "target_lang_word": "misanthropy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "misanthropy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ec7af9f-c48c-3f41-b7b8-a268bb02445b",
                                        "entry_id": "e06bd508-eb3e-3faa-95f5-2735485b724c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A negative view or hatred of the human race."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef47f663-28b0-4012-9475-ab413aa7f32f",
                                                "sense_id": "8ec7af9f-c48c-3f41-b7b8-a268bb02445b",
                                                "text": "1817, Percy Bysshe Shelley, The Revolt of Islam, Author's Preface\nHence gloom and misanthropy have become the characteristics of the age in which we live, the solace of a disappointment that unconsciously finds relief only in the wilful exaggeration of its own despair."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7008ae1d-97ce-44a4-bd33-d1cd430aaaa5",
                                                "sense_id": "8ec7af9f-c48c-3f41-b7b8-a268bb02445b",
                                                "text": "According to this saga of intellectual-property misanthropy, these creatures [patent trolls] roam the business world, buying up patents and then using them to demand extravagant payouts from companies they accuse of infringing them. Often, their victims pay up rather than face the costs of a legal battle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07e47188-581d-40f1-96e2-fa3a3ecd7458",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aa3c0ab-f600-3049-8a89-76e6d61c2dac",
                        "source_sense_id": "b96699fc-136f-34b4-9a27-0f9797d20734",
                        "target_lang_word": "misanthropie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "misanthropie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c8ff165-60b0-3c38-bee4-1b03c85209a4",
                                        "entry_id": "045735c9-3fce-3995-b8af-c1727782f7fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sentiment, caractère de celui qui éprouve de l’hostilité, voire de la haine envers le genre humain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "368f74a6-067f-4cae-b5a9-295210f1c530",
                                                "sense_id": "9c8ff165-60b0-3c38-bee4-1b03c85209a4",
                                                "text": "Tantôt, elle composait les baumes, elle inventait les recherches, les musiques, les mille moyens par lesquels elle aurait calmé la féroce misanthropie de Jean-Jacques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c24f1534-f057-42a7-a28f-7f8527e8b734",
                                                "sense_id": "9c8ff165-60b0-3c38-bee4-1b03c85209a4",
                                                "text": "M. Earnshaw ne répondit pas. Il marchait de long en large avec ses mains dans ses poches, paraissant avoir complètement oublié ma présence ; il semblait si profondément absorbé, et son aspect général dénotait tant de misanthropie que je ne pus me décider à le déranger de nouveau."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a8e58878-9903-4a7a-869e-4343b0404fad",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aa3c0ab-f600-3049-8a89-76e6d61c2dac",
                        "source_sense_id": "b96699fc-136f-34b4-9a27-0f9797d20734",
                        "target_lang_word": "misantropía",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "misantropía",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4180073a-9ac4-3b0b-b851-7cc9065676df",
                                        "entry_id": "6c1849b2-3957-3b7a-a54a-4eda232dde04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Condición o carácter de misántropo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "49387c77-c37a-4895-8da1-bedf4ce7cf79",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aa3c0ab-f600-3049-8a89-76e6d61c2dac",
                        "source_sense_id": "b96699fc-136f-34b4-9a27-0f9797d20734",
                        "target_lang_word": "Misanthropie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Misanthropie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc5c0b02-8e38-30d2-91ff-9bebf805ba2b",
                                        "entry_id": "6a8cf6e1-cbdb-37ae-adbf-d7e5a8a19e3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "bestimmendes Merkmal von Misanthropen und Misanthropinnen; unspezifischer Hass auf Menschen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ba02d44-5cf2-40a7-8316-6eea65f54818",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5c0b02-8e38-30d2-91ff-9bebf805ba2b",
                                                "text": "„Das Nichtvorhandensein von Misanthropie bedeutet keineswegs Philanthropie.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc5c6e43-22f7-4f4b-92a2-fd1a22e26186",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5c0b02-8e38-30d2-91ff-9bebf805ba2b",
                                                "text": "„Seine Misanthropie war zunächst Versuch, der über ihm zusammenschlagenden Welle von Verachtung die Handlungsmacht zu entreissen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8030f318-7eb4-439c-b6e8-e3c0eb44720b",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5c0b02-8e38-30d2-91ff-9bebf805ba2b",
                                                "text": "„Die positive Würdigung der ersten Lebenshälfte, ihrer Poesie, ihrer Illusionen und Leidenschaften, gehört konstitutiv mit hinein in diesen Pessimismus und diese Misanthropie.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "737d7204-4c20-4aa2-b34e-5a647ae1d275",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5c0b02-8e38-30d2-91ff-9bebf805ba2b",
                                                "text": "„Das Wort Misanthrop scheine, so schrieb er, buchstäblich genommen einen Hass auf die gesamte Menschheit zu implizieren. Eine solche Misanthropie à la lettre sei tatsächlich verächtlich, komme aber in der Realität kaum vor.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1deaf7dc-8b4b-4c76-bc66-a3421d376ed4",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aa3c0ab-f600-3049-8a89-76e6d61c2dac",
                        "source_sense_id": "b96699fc-136f-34b4-9a27-0f9797d20734",
                        "target_lang_word": "мизантропия",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "мизантропия",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4a72434-88dc-31ab-bb0c-77fbcfa0fd49",
                                        "entry_id": "4f655918-6542-308c-8cbe-23827ba4d2ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "книжн. человеконенавистничество, ненависть по отношению к людям"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d555b2dc-0ea8-48a6-895e-ee1e363176b3",
                                                "sense_id": "a4a72434-88dc-31ab-bb0c-77fbcfa0fd49",
                                                "text": "Моя относительная нелюдимость, которая есть просто признак здорового ума, предпочитающего проводить время наедине с самим собою и книгами, чем тратить его на праздную и пустую болтовню, могла сойти за болезненную мизантропию."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08718f3d-033d-4166-854e-ceeb4d3858e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aa3c0ab-f600-3049-8a89-76e6d61c2dac",
                        "source_sense_id": "b96699fc-136f-34b4-9a27-0f9797d20734",
                        "target_lang_word": "человеконенавистничество",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "человеконенавистничество",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "538ae089-5729-38ca-9bf9-2d3cfc3f1a63",
                                        "entry_id": "63d68e87-791b-3410-9952-b9bfa1cc7837",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ненависть по отношению к людям"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b1ef7bc-58ab-429d-a03d-b63e63713898",
                                                "sense_id": "538ae089-5729-38ca-9bf9-2d3cfc3f1a63",
                                                "text": "Вся история человечества — вялотекущее человеконенавистничество, иногда переходящее в ярость."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6fa25f9-e531-4c4a-9ff3-607427056b5e",
                                                "sense_id": "538ae089-5729-38ca-9bf9-2d3cfc3f1a63",
                                                "text": "Повторяю: я убеждён, что честные люди не только пребудут честными, но и победят, и что на стороне человеконенавистничества останутся лишь люди, вконец раздавленные личными интересами."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
